<title>USA: PSA developing commercial paper model agreements.</title>
<headline>PSA developing commercial paper model agreements.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Public Securities Association (PSA) said it is developing model agreements for commercial paper issuers and dealers.</p>
<p>The model agreements, which outline the rights and obligations of both parties, offer a framework of basic legal and economic provisions for commercial paper transactions, PSA said.</p>
<p>PSA expects to finalize the agreements by yearend.</p>
<p>--N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660</p>
